  "final_correction_after_full_suite": "Settings recorder focus restoration now skips the absent Record button while reset confirmation replaces the inspector. Folder revalidation also updates the status count after grant changes; the final test asserts zero after revocation. File search evidence waits for settled status. Review corrections add cancellation-safe grant ownership and clear stale alias feedback; final targeted tests cover those paths, and thirteen deterministic JVM tests cover the grant transaction, with a three-failure negative control for the old bookkeeping placement. The final storage correction uses a process-wide coordinator, verifies committed bytes, and passes two real Android AtomicFile interleaving/failure regressions. Restoring the instance-local mutex deterministically deletes the paused pending write. Full suites use the earlier APK listed under full_suite_build; the final hardware run independently passes sixteen main cases and five Alt+Q cases with restoration; final targeted suites and screenshots use the final APK.",
